WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.690
Luffy has changed. A lot. And I bet you may
not remember the time Luffy absorbed the power

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:09.269
of one hundred shadows. You probably also
forgot the time he went undercover inside

00:00:09.269 --> 00:00:13.530
a marine base. And you definitely didn’t
know about the time Luffy became a literal

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:19.029
thunder giant all the way back in 2009. Well
in this video we’re going to explain every

00:00:19.029 --> 00:00:24.230
single step in the evolution of Luffy on his
path to become pirate king. And in the impossible

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:29.740
case that you actually DO remember every single
version of Luffy in this video, you can truly

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.300
call yourself a One Piece master.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Starting with Luffy as a kid. When Luffy first
meets Shanks, he is 7 years old. Determined

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:41.431
to be a pirate, Luffy stabs himself in the
face, just to show Shank that's he was brave

00:00:41.431 --> 00:00:45.390
enough to join the crew. The Red-Haired captain
says he is still too young. While Luffy is

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.630
disappointed, he has earned the respect of
Shanks’ crew. Which is great until…

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:55.109
Luffy eats his legendary devil fruit. For
now, an enraged Shanks tells Luffy that his

00:00:55.109 --> 00:01:00.609
entire body has become rubber and he can longer
swim. Pretty silly, right? Well just wait

00:01:00.609 --> 00:01:05.470
until you see how this one bite of fruit changes
Luffy’s life forever. Soon after Luffy is

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:10.010
saved from bandits, he gets his iconic straw
hat from Shanks and promises that he will

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:11.820
become a great pirate.

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:16.650
That promise begins by training with his adopted
brothers, Ace and Sabo. These three grow stronger

00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:21.410
by fighting wild beasts of the jungle and
Luffy learns to control his new rubber body.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:26.690
Beyond growing stronger, Ace, Sabo, and Luffy
form a bond of brotherhood that teaches Luffy

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.490
to never give up on his friends.

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:34.259
Now skipping forward, seventeen-year old Luffy
starts his journey. He is strong, confident,

00:01:34.259 --> 00:01:38.610
and dreams of becoming king of the pirates.
He sets out on a small boat ready to gather

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:40.049
a strong crew.

00:01:40.049 --> 00:01:45.080
Luffy’s next step is to become a real pirate
captain. In chapter 42, Luffy is given a proper

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:50.200
ship after saving Usopp’s hometown. Together
with his three crewmates they design their

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:54.030
first flag. And if you don’t know, flags
and other symbols are incredibly important

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:58.930
in the One Piece story. Stick around and you’ll
see why. This smiling symbol shows the world

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:04.090
that the Straw Hat Pirates have arrived, bringing
hope to many across the world. Luffy is truly

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:07.430
a captain now, but he has much to learn.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:11.510
Including that pirates are not the only force
in the world. After defeating the fishman

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:16.340
Arlong and freeing Nami’s village, Luffy
becomes a wanted man. With a bounty of 30

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:20.129
million berries, the World Government has
taken notice of Luffy’s victories in the

00:02:20.129 --> 00:02:26.290
East Blue. They decide he is now enough of
a threat that they would pay for his capture.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:31.150
It goes to show that in addition to making
friends, Luffy is gaining enemies.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:35.640
And the World Government almost gets their
wish right away. In Logue Town, the scene

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:41.430
of Gol D. Roger’s execution, Luffy is captured
and almost executed by the pirate Buggy the

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:47.640
Clown. But despite knives hanging over his
neck, Luffy laughs at death. He shouts to

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:52.340
the onlooking crowd that he is more than happy
to die in pursuit of his dreams.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:58.801
Those who knew Roger are struck by the similarities
between this rubber boy and the former pirate

00:02:58.801 --> 00:02:59.801
king.

00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:03.431
And just like Roger, it seems that Luffy is
protected by more than his strong will and

00:03:03.431 --> 00:03:10.120
desire. A freak storm sets him free, and now
he and his crew finally enter the Grand Line.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:15.209
This is where pirates make their name and
those wishing to become pirate king are truly

00:03:15.209 --> 00:03:16.209
tested.

00:03:16.209 --> 00:03:21.330
Still, Luffy has much more to learn if he
wants to protect his friends and pursue his

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:22.330
dreams.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:26.670
Speaking of dreams, do you remember we mentioned
flags are important? Well in Drum Island,

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:31.710
Luffy takes a full cannon blast to protect
the flag of Dr. Hiriluk. This quack doctor

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:36.480
is the man who raised Chopper and gave us
one of the most famous quotes in One Piece.

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:41.629
By protecting the flag, Luffy shows his friends
that no one will get in the way of their dreams.

00:03:41.629 --> 00:03:47.170
And this bravery convinces Chopper to pursue
his own dream and join the crew.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:52.189
But Luffy’s faith is quickly tested when
he gets impaled on the hook of the Warlord

00:03:52.189 --> 00:03:56.530
Crocodile. While fighting against the Sand
devil fruit user, Luffy is unable to land

00:03:56.530 --> 00:04:02.170
even a single blow. The Warlord mocks Luffy’s
dreams and throws him into the sand to die.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:07.230
While Luffy survives, this is his first major
defeat by a villain and it shows us all that

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:10.890
he has a long way to go before he is king
of anything.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:15.610
Luckily, learning is one of Luffy’s biggest
strengths. Especially, when it comes to battle.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:20.759
In their next fight, Luffy uses this ridiculous
looking form where he has drunk an absurd

00:04:20.759 --> 00:04:25.810
amount of water. You see, Luffy has learned
that because each Logia devil fruit turns

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:31.060
their user into an element, each of them also
has a unique natural weakness. And since Crocodile

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:35.539
is made of sand, getting him wet makes the
sand of his body stick together, allowing

00:04:35.539 --> 00:04:38.190
Luffy to actually land his attacks.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:43.009
And even though Luffy loses this battle, he
eventually manages to defeat Crocodile just

00:04:43.009 --> 00:04:48.750
a short while later and saves the kingdom
of Alabasta. Now having defeated his first

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:55.600
Warlord, Luffy earns his second bounty. With
an increase from 30 million to 100 million

00:04:55.600 --> 00:05:00.000
berries. This shows that the world Government
views Luffy as a growing threat and wants

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.750
him taken care of.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:07.100
However, bounties are not the only measure
of strength. On the island of Jaya, Luffy,

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:12.750
Nami, and Zoro are mocked by the pirate Bellemy,
who spills food and drink over the straw hats.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:17.530
Bellemy states that pirate dreams are foolish
and that Luffy and his crew should be afraid

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:23.090
of him. But this moment shows how much Luffy
has matured since we saw him as a child in

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:27.910
chapter one. Instead of fighting back against
pirates who are beneath him, Luffy simply

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:33.370
walks away, a striking similarity to Shanks
all the way back at the start of the series.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:38.780
But that’s the last time Bellemy takes advantage
of Luffy and his friends. The next time Luffy

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:42.750
sees Bellemy, the pirate has beat up these
guys [show cricket and his crew] and Luffy

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:47.259
is out for revenge. Despite Bellemy springing
around with the power of his devil fruit,

00:05:47.259 --> 00:05:53.630
Luffy delivers one of the most iconic punches
in the series, taking out Bellemy with a single

00:05:53.630 --> 00:05:58.669
hit. This shows Bellemy not to underestimate
the power of dreams or make judgements based

00:05:58.669 --> 00:06:00.880
only on bounty.

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:05.540
Also on Jaya, Luffy’s rising bounty has
drawn the attention of Blackbeard. These two

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:10.770
pirates will be connected throughout the entire
story. Eiichiro Oda, the author of One Piece,

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:16.220
introduces Blackbeard as Luffy’s physical
and philosophical opposite. Luffy is small.

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:23.319
Blackbeard is large. Luffy is honest. Blackbeard
is deceptive. Luffy loves cherry pie. Blackbeard

00:06:23.319 --> 00:06:28.150
hates it. They are the light and the dark.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:32.229
However, they both believe in the power of
dreams.

00:06:32.229 --> 00:06:37.009
Later, the Straw Hats escape from Blackbeard’s
attempt to capture them. And while Luffy thinks

00:06:37.009 --> 00:06:41.979
Blackbeard is strange, he cannot imagine the
pain this man will cause him and the hate

00:06:41.979 --> 00:06:43.840
he will later feel towards Blackbeard.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.060
Now the only thing we love more about Luffy
than his growing strength and fame are the

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:51.449
countless times he makes his friends or the
viewers laugh. In fact, there are so many

00:06:51.449 --> 00:06:55.720
instances of Luffy acting comically stupid
that it would probably deserve a video of

00:06:55.720 --> 00:07:01.030
its own. But I still want to focus on a few
examples here. Just on Skypiea for instance,

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:05.599
Luffy makes fun of both Zoro and Sanji as
they head towards a deadly trial. He hilariously

00:07:05.599 --> 00:07:10.129
turns his brain off in order to fight Enel.
And he throws a massive party with the wild

00:07:10.129 --> 00:07:11.130
animals of the forest.

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:15.330
And by the way, it is this exact scene right
here [bonfire scene] that Oda has stated is

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:19.379
one of his top three favorite scenes he has
ever drawn. The bonfire scene hints at Luffy’s

00:07:19.379 --> 00:07:23.150
most dangerous ability. At anytime, anywhere
in the world, this man can make friends. Partying,

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:28.410
laughing, and having fun, he gives hope to
those in need and freedom to those who are

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:32.379
slaves. Turns out, this is our first major
piece of foreshadowing for Luffy’s true

00:07:32.379 --> 00:07:34.330
power at the end of this video.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:39.860
Speaking of liberation, Skypiea is also the
first time Luffy fights a so-called god of

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:44.610
the One Piece world. In this arc, the Lighting
fruit user Enel has enslaved the citizens

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:49.599
of Skypiea. He is about to destroy the land
and people before traveling to the moon. But

00:07:49.599 --> 00:07:55.770
with a ball of gold stuck on his arm, Luffy
defeats Enel, ringing the legendary bell of

00:07:55.770 --> 00:08:00.610
Shandora. The ringing of the bell travels
far down to the sea, giving Luffy’s friends

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:04.389
hope and reminding them to never give up on
their dreams.

00:08:04.389 --> 00:08:10.030
And one dream we only got to see in the anime
is Luffy’s time as a marine. In the G8 filler

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:15.060
episodes, Luffy and the crew are stuck in
a marine facility. But even disguised as a

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:19.030
marine, Luffy can’t resist stealing food
right off the Vice-Admiral’s plate. And

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:24.360
this is the closest he gets to fulfilling
his grandfather’s dream of Luffy becoming

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:27.350
a marine. But if you’ve ever wondered what
Luffy’s life would have really been like

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:32.650
if he chose to be a marine instead of a pirate,
you can click this video right here.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:38.380
And one other thing I bet you never expected
to see in One Piece is Afro Luffy. I mean

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:43.540
come on. Who wouldn’t want this marvelous
head of hair in their lives? We can all offer

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:48.459
our thanks to god Usopp for giving Luffy this
incredible makeover.

00:08:48.459 --> 00:08:54.130
But while they’re still joking around here,
these two best friends actually face a major

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:59.630
conflict in Water 7 just a short while later.
And it’s here we see Luffy’s first major

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:04.680
test as captain. With their ship unable to
sail further, Luffy decides to buy a new one

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:09.510
to be able to continue their journey. Usopp
is outraged. He doesn’t want to abandon

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:14.870
this ship for 2 reasons. Number 1, they had
received it as a thank you for saving Usopp’s

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:20.520
village. But number 2, Usopp had been the
one to repair the ship throughout their adventures.

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:24.410
Up until this point, Usopp has been feeling
more and more useless compared to everyone

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:29.620
else in the crew, and repairing their ship
was his justification for being part of Luffy’s

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:35.890
crew. So when Luffy makes this choice, Usopp
fears he will be left behind as well and rejects

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:38.570
his decision by challenging Luffy to a duel.

00:09:38.570 --> 00:09:42.930
As you can imagine, this does not go well
for Usopp. Through bitter tears, the crew

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:48.880
watches Luffy assert himself as captain and
Usopp is defeated. And he then leaves the

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:49.880
crew for a time.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:54.670
Now while hard to watch, this marks an important
development for the Straw Hat captain. As

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:58.620
Zoro comments, if the crew can’t believe
in their captain’s decisions, the crew will

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:03.490
fall apart. In this case, Luffy shows us that
he is growing as a leader. And even though

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:08.570
it is difficult to watch his best friend suffer,
he can make tough decisions for the wellbeing

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:09.570
of the crew.

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:14.730
But at the same time he’s still our loveable
idiot Luffy, somehow managing getting stuck

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.630
between two buildings.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:22.440
And it’s here that Luffy faces his biggest
challenge yet. With Robin kidnapped and the

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:27.800
crew unable to defeat these secret government
agents, Luffy comes up with a new technique:

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.040
Gear 2nd.

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:34.440
With this power up, Luffy uses his rubber
body to pump oxygen to his muscles faster

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:41.450
than humanly possible. This gives him a huge
boost in speed and power, allowing him to

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:47.250
finally defeat one of the secret agents. However,
this power up is not without risks, because

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.300
this technique will likely shorten Luffy’s
lifespan.

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:55.670
But as Luffy learned from Ace and Sabo, nothing
else matters when you need to protect your

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:56.670
friends.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:11:01.240
Immediately after, the crew stares across
the gap between themselves and the world government

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:06.551
agents. Robin is still captured and tells
the crew to leave her behind. But Luffy sees

00:11:06.551 --> 00:11:11.810
the burden the World Government has put upon
Robin and he orders Usopp to shoot down the

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:16.860
government’s flag, basically a declaration
of war. As the flag burns, this act tells

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:23.490
Robin that the crew will do anything or will
fight anyone to protect their friends. Luffy

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:28.890
begs Robin to tell them what she really wants,
and in response she screams: “I want to

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:29.890
live”.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:36.430
For all of Luffy’s steps so far, this one
is most significant. There is no going back

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:42.029
from challenging the World Government, and
now the rulers of the world have their eyes

00:11:42.029 --> 00:11:43.029
on him.

00:11:43.029 --> 00:11:49.690
And just like any other challenge, Luffy rises
to face it. Or in this case, literally grows.

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:55.880
When fighting the government’s most dangerous
secret agent, Luffy reveals another new form:

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:56.880
Gear 3rd.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:02.160
To achieve this form, Luffy blows air straight
into his rubber bones, making any part of

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:06.500
his body supersized. Leading to this [end
of ch 421], this [end of ch 510], this [ch

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:07.500
547 luffy giant stamp], and…

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.100
…this? *confused tone* [show chibi luffy]
Remember when we said Luffy’s power ups

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:17.190
have down sides? Well, after Luffy first uses
Gear 3, it temporarily turns him into this

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:23.240
chibi Luffy. Eventually, Luffy grows strong
enough to not have this side effect, but for

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:25.640
a time it is quite hilarious.

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:30.590
Now after rescuing Robin and escaping from
the World Government, it is time for Luffy’s

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:37.199
3rd Bounty. 300 million berries. Three times
his last bounty. Truly, Luffy has arrived

00:12:37.199 --> 00:12:41.610
and has proven himself a force to be taken
seriously in the Grand Line.

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:46.170
And Luffy’s grown so much, he doesn’t
even need to fight zombies, he just pushes

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.940
them back into the ground.

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:52.360
Now, that was a lot of story progression for
Luffy. Next let’s take a quick look at some

00:12:52.360 --> 00:12:57.389
of the most unique forms Luffy has taken in
the story, as well as the incredible loyalty

00:12:57.389 --> 00:12:59.279
and spirit of his crew.

00:12:59.279 --> 00:13:03.949
First is Oar’s Luffy. When Luffy’s shadow
is stolen by Warlord Gecko Moria, it is placed

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:08.839
into the frozen body of the demon giant Oars.
Based on Moria’s devil fruit powers, the

00:13:08.839 --> 00:13:13.110
revived Oars should be under his control,
but Luffy’s strong will sends Oars on a

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:18.660
rampaging search for meat. Classic Luffy.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:22.810
But eventually, Oars must follow Moria’s
orders and the straw hat crew is unable to

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:26.830
stop the giant demon. That is, until we get
this [show nightmare luffy]. By absorbing

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:33.230
the power of one hundred shadows, Luffy transforms
into this dark, super form with the power

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:38.730
to easily stop Oars’ massive punch. While
this form only lasts for a short time, Luffy’s

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:43.430
ability to command the shadows of so many
individuals demonstrates the strength of his

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:44.430
spirit.

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:48.510
But what’s more impressive is the sheer
damage that Luffy takes in order to protect

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:54.310
his friends. In one of the most creative visuals
of damage I have ever seen in any series,

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:57.560
Luffy literally becomes pain.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:02.420
After defeating Moria, the Warlord Kuma arrives
and wipes out the exhausted straw hat crew.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:07.250
Kuma’s purpose is to eliminate Luffy for
the World Government. But both Zoro and Sanji

00:14:07.250 --> 00:14:11.579
demand to take Luffy’s place. Kuma is so
impressed by their loyalty to their captain

00:14:11.579 --> 00:14:17.060
that instead of killing Luffy, Kuma uses his
Paw fruit powers to repel all the pain Luffy

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:24.040
has taken. He gives it to Zoro, resulting
in one of the most iconic scenes in one piece.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:25.100
Nothing happened.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.990
Except that Zoro almost dies.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:33.430
However, this sacrifice shows just how much
the crew cares for their captain. And Kuma

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.360
departs full of respect for the straw hat
crew.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:41.720
Which is a huge contrast to the respect this
space-suit wearing world noble deserves. The

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:46.140
celestial dragons are the rulers of the world
government and self-proclaimed gods. When

00:14:46.140 --> 00:14:51.600
he decides to purchase Luffy’s friend as
a slave, Luffy punches him so hard, it sends

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:55.160
shockwaves around the world.

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:59.800
Marines quickly arrive to rescue the world
noble. And Luffy welcomes the challenge. But

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:04.529
what he doesn’t know is just how unprepared
he is for what is to come.

00:15:04.529 --> 00:15:10.089
With the marines and cyborg Pacifistas sent
to capture them, the straw hats struggle to

00:15:10.089 --> 00:15:15.610
stay alive. They are still wounded from their
fight with Moria, and are soundly defeated.

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:20.140
They only survive death because of Kuma, who
instead of killing them scatters each of the

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:23.110
crew to the far corners of the world.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:29.860
Alone, wounded, and full of doubts, Luffy
is at his lowest point. Or so he thinks.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:34.980
Now one step in Luffy’s evolution you may
not be familiar with is Thor Luffy. That’s

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:39.600
right. The god of thunder himself. No not
that one [show gear 5 quickly]. This one.

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:44.889
In the movie Strong World, Luffy battles Roger’s
former rival Shiki. Fighting under a storm

00:15:44.889 --> 00:15:50.220
cloud, Luffy launches his foot into the storm
and brings down an electric strike on Shiki’s

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.420
head, defeating the former rival of Roger.

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:56.670
Alongside Luffy’s resistance to lightning,
another recurring plot point is Luffy’s

00:15:56.670 --> 00:16:01.980
ability to survive poison. We see this emphasized
in the underwater government prison, Impel

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:06.300
Down, where Luffy is attempting to rescue
his captured brother Ace. When Luffy fights

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:11.339
against the warden of the jail, he is covered
with so much poison a normal man would have

00:16:11.339 --> 00:16:16.860
died instantly. But Luffy survives due to
his new friends and his tremendous will to

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:17.860
live.

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:22.970
Now, while Luffy can be quite dumb at times,
we’ve already seen that his battle intelligence

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:27.790
is outstanding. During the prison escape,
Luffy protects his fellow escapees by wearing

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:32.610
wax armor to keep back the poisonous warden.
This protection allows them enough time to

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:37.981
escape Impel Down, which was previously said
to be impossible. Another insult to the world

00:16:37.981 --> 00:16:38.981
government.

00:16:38.981 --> 00:16:43.089
However, the world government and the marines
would quickly have their revenge.

00:16:43.089 --> 00:16:48.880
You see, Luffy rushes to save his brother,
who set to be publicly executed in Marineford,

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:53.420
the main base of the marines. While Luffy
is outmatched by the upper class fighters

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:59.110
of the marines, his determination to save
his brother earns him the respect many strong

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:04.770
pirates. Including the Emperor of the Sea
Whitebeard, who is also trying to rescue Ace.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:09.809
But even their combined assault doesn’t
stop the marines from beginning the execution.

00:17:09.809 --> 00:17:15.030
And it is now that Luffy fully announces himself
as a candidate to be the pirate king.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:21.270
As the blades come down on Ace’s neck, Luffy
unleashes his most dominant power. Conquerors

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:26.640
Haki - The will of the Supreme King. This
burst of willpower knocks out weak individuals

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.750
and gives Luffy time to rescue his brother.
As the stunned marines and pirates look on,

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:36.110
the marine admiral Akainu decides Luffy is
just as much a threat as Ace and vows to kill

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.240
them both.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.460
Luffy succeeds in freeing Ace, and the brothers
escape…

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:41.460
Almost.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:46.090
With Luffy powerless to stop Admiral Akainu,
Ace sacrifices himself so that Luffy can live.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:52.570
*short pause* Ace dies. *short pause* And
Luffy’s will crumbles. He is unable to process

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:54.650
the loss of his beloved brother.

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:59.490
It is a painful reminder that for all the
progress Luffy has made, he is still far away

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:04.530
from being able to protect his friends from
the strongest fighters in the seas.

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:09.910
Grief almost breaks Luffy, and only thinking
about the love of his crew helps him recover.

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:15.850
He is their captain, and if he is going to
protect them, Luffy must continue to grow

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:20.270
stronger. So Luffy decides they all need to
train. And the straw hats disappear from the

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:21.270
world of pirates.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:26.700
For two years, Luffy trains with Rayleigh,
learning the basics of Haki that will allow

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:33.130
him to fight the monsters that await. This
is an opportunity to learn from a master,

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:39.110
but Luffy far surpasses Rayleigh’s expectations.
It takes Luffy only 18 months to learn the

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:43.679
basics of haki, and then Rayleigh leaves so
Luffy can further develop on his own.

00:18:43.679 --> 00:18:49.500
Two years later the world has changed. Including
our favorite captain. In fact, he looks like

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:53.520
this? [Fake Luffy] No wait…this? [How Boa
sees Luffy] No. Okay, this? [Mustache Luffy].

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.700
Alright, seriously though.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:59.610
Luffy returns to Sabaody where his crew is
waiting. He is stronger, full of confidence,

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:04.700
and ready to continue his journey. But the
marines are also waiting. Faced by the same

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:11.011
enemies from two years ago, Luffy shows exactly
why he has earned his new&nbsp;400 million berry

00:19:11.011 --> 00:19:17.270
bounty by easily defeating the cyborg Pacifictas
that nearly killed his crew 2 years ago.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:22.870
It is a giant leap forward. And speaking of
giants, Luffy becomes one in his anime fight

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:27.090
with former marine Shuzo. While this time
he needed size-shifting Lily’s assistance

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:31.940
to become giant, it won’t be the last time
we see a giant straw hat captain before the

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.640
end of this video.

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:39.030
Luffy continues to show off his new powers
in Fishman island. Surrounded by 100 thousand

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:44.620
enemy fishmen, Luffy knocks out 50 thousand
of them with a single burst on Conqueror’s

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:50.450
Haki. He is one of only a few characters in
the entire series who have this unique haki

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.450
ability.

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:55.539
Another new power is the special move, Red
Hawk. When fighting the fishman villain Hody

00:19:55.539 --> 00:20:01.130
Jones, Luffy ignites his arm, finishing the
fight with a fiery punch, which he created

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:06.309
in memory of his fallen brother Fire-fist
Ace. Most importantly it’s a sign that he

00:20:06.309 --> 00:20:10.710
has finally made peace with his brother’s
death. While it doesn’t make any sense why

00:20:10.710 --> 00:20:16.370
a rubber person should be able to conjure
up fire powers, it all makes sense when Luffy’s

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:20.440
true abilities are revealed hundreds of chapters
later.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:24.909
And speaking of power ups, Luffy’s ultimate
transformation is this: Centaur Luffy [Luffy

00:20:24.909 --> 00:20:28.820
with Kinemon’s legs from Punk Hazard. No
other explanation needed.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:33.780
And now that Luffy has announced himself back
on the stage, he enters the realm of pirate

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:39.380
politics for the first time. On Punk Hazard,
Luffy and the warlord Trafalgar Law, form

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:44.920
an alliance to take down Emperor of the Sea,
Kaido: the strongest creature alive. This

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:49.929
marks another super important step for Luffy.
Even though Robin warns that pirate alliances

00:20:49.929 --> 00:20:55.820
end in betrayal, Luffy chooses to trust Law
as they both seek to rise to the top of the

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.260
pirate world.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:21:02.180
But at their current power levels, neither
would have even the slightest chance against

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:07.150
Kaido yet. However, this alliance shows one
of Luffy’s greatest strengths as a captain.

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:11.539
He knows he can’t achieve his dreams all
on his own. If it weren’t for his friends

00:21:11.539 --> 00:21:17.049
he would get lost, starve, or die of some
random poison. But instead of being prideful,

00:21:17.049 --> 00:21:22.529
he offers and accepts help for everyone’s
benefit. That’s something we should all

00:21:22.529 --> 00:21:23.620
learn from Luffy.

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:28.260
Something we shouldn’t learn from Luffy
on the other hand is disguises. Here he gains

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:33.190
quite the following fighting in the Dressrosa
Colosseum dressed as the old man Lucy.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:38.470
It is also in Dressrosa that we get our next
step in Luffy’s Gears. With Doflamingo turning

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:44.370
the world into string around the straw hats,
a desperate Luffy unveils Gear 4. This bouncing

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:49.080
ball of rubber and haki is the result of Luffy’s
training for two years.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:54.409
While this form grants Luffy superior speed
and power, the initial downside is that he

00:21:54.409 --> 00:21:59.710
quickly loses his energy. When he runs out,
Gear 4 deflates and Luffy is unable to use

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:04.960
Haki for ten minutes. When Doflamingo survives
Luffy’s first round of Gear 4, Luffy must

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:11.880
rely on his friends to delay the puppet master.
Which they do, barely. But it is enough for

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:16.260
Luffy to return and punch Doflamingo straight
through the ground.

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:21.960
This is another warlord defeated by Luffy.
Now the path to become an Emperor begins.

00:22:21.960 --> 00:22:27.760
So it is fitting that Luffy - along with earning
a new bounty of 500 million berries - also

00:22:27.760 --> 00:22:33.030
gains a larger following at the end of Dressrosa.
Many of the fighters who took down the Doflamingo

00:22:33.030 --> 00:22:38.950
family pledge their allegiance to Luffy. This
forms the Straw Hat Grand Fleet, a strong

00:22:38.950 --> 00:22:43.260
group of pirate captains who will come to
Luffy’s aid when called upon.

00:22:43.260 --> 00:22:45.419
And the party doesn’t stop there.

00:22:45.419 --> 00:22:49.580
On this giant walking elephant, Luffy makes
an alliance with the animal mink tribe of

00:22:49.580 --> 00:22:54.200
Zou and the samurai of Wano to take down Kaido.
In addition, they learn they must collect

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:58.840
the Road Poneglyphs in order to find Laugh
Tale, the island where the One Piece treasure

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:00.500
can be found.

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:06.279
This is a huge moment for Luffy. Remember
he only started with a small boat and a dream.

00:23:06.279 --> 00:23:12.110
Now he has a badass crew, tons of allies,
and he has a clear picture of how to find

00:23:12.110 --> 00:23:16.270
the One Piece. Truly he has come a long way.

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:19.420
But there’s still much further to go.

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:23.250
Now, when training with Rayleigh during the
time skip, Luffy was told that Haki blooms

00:23:23.250 --> 00:23:28.550
most during battle. We see this when Luffy
goes to the territory of Big Mom, another

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:33.270
Emperor of the Sea. When fighting one of Big
Mom’s commanders, Luffy uses Tank Man, a

00:23:33.270 --> 00:23:38.090
buffed up, sumo version of Gear 4. This form
allows him to defeat the commander and start

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:41.320
his march towards rescuing Sanji from Big
Mom.

00:23:41.320 --> 00:23:47.100
To do this, Luffy makes another agreement
with a pirate, Capone Gang Bege. In this meeting,

00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:52.279
the two captains plot a way to take down Big
Mom. AND we get the most dapped up version

00:23:52.279 --> 00:23:54.500
of Luffy to date. [show cartoon version].
No this one. [show suited up Luffy ch 858].

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:55.500
Pretty clean in my opinion.

00:23:55.500 --> 00:24:00.590
While we don’t get a full flight between
Big Mom and Luffy yet, Luffy fights for hours

00:24:00.590 --> 00:24:05.320
with Big Mom’s strongest son, Charlotte
Katakuri. It is during this fight that Luffy

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.770
learns his first form of advanced Haki: Future
Sight. When fully concentrating, both Luffy

00:24:10.770 --> 00:24:16.740
and Katakuri can see moments into the future.
As their fight drags on, Luffy also unveils

00:24:16.740 --> 00:24:23.029
Snake Man. This form emphasizes speed. Along
with future sight, it is a frightening combination

00:24:23.029 --> 00:24:26.450
for opponents and another step forward for
Luffy.

00:24:26.450 --> 00:24:30.580
After defeating Katakuri, Luffy and the crew
escape Big Mom’s territory intact and with

00:24:30.580 --> 00:24:35.620
a copy of Big Mom’s Road poneglyph. This
incredible feat has only previously been accomplished

00:24:35.620 --> 00:24:40.850
by former Pirate King Roger. This also marks
the moment that much of the world views Luffy

00:24:40.850 --> 00:24:46.250
as an Emperor of the Sea. He gets a massive
bounty increase to 1.5 billion berries and

00:24:46.250 --> 00:24:50.610
for the first time he has survived a conflict
with an Emperor's crew.

00:24:50.610 --> 00:24:54.720
However, according the Shanks, Luffy still
isn’t ready to fulfill their promise of

00:24:54.720 --> 00:24:58.799
becoming a great pirate. Quite the demanding
mentor.

00:24:58.799 --> 00:25:04.020
Luffy finally reaches those heights in Wano,
land of the samurai. Filled with the spirit

00:25:04.020 --> 00:25:08.941
of bushido, Luffy grabs his own sword, but
clearly doesn’t know how to use it. And

00:25:08.941 --> 00:25:14.530
Zoro is horrified to see Luffy *punching*
with the sword. Someone please take Luffy’s

00:25:14.530 --> 00:25:16.200
sword away before he hurts himself.

00:25:16.200 --> 00:25:20.621
And it is in Wano that we get our first full
out fight with an Emperor of the Sea. After

00:25:20.621 --> 00:25:25.690
Luffy believes Kaido killed his crew, Luffy
attacks the azure dragon, raining punches

00:25:25.690 --> 00:25:32.470
on the drunken Emperor. But he doesn’t even
leave a scratch. When Kaido fights seriously,

00:25:32.470 --> 00:25:38.010
Luffy is taken out in one hit, leading to
his imprisonment and training arc for Prisoner

00:25:38.010 --> 00:25:39.010
Luffy.

00:25:39.010 --> 00:25:43.110
And just like Luffy learned advanced observation
Haki fighting Katakuri, in the Wano prison

00:25:43.110 --> 00:25:48.250
Luffy&nbsp; learns about advanced armament Haki
- also known as Ryo. This technique allows

00:25:48.250 --> 00:25:53.779
Luffy to extend his haki coating into another
object, destroying it from the inside. With

00:25:53.779 --> 00:25:59.410
weeks of practice, he masters Ryo and believes
he now has what it takes to fight toe to toe

00:25:59.410 --> 00:26:00.410
with Kaido.

00:26:00.410 --> 00:26:04.880
This leads us to the raid on Kaido’s castle,
where on the top of the skull dome Luffy confronts

00:26:04.880 --> 00:26:10.460
the newly allied Kaido AND Big Mom. Here we
see our fully fledged captain squaring off

00:26:10.460 --> 00:26:16.080
with confidence against the strongest fighters
in the one piece world. He is now truly fighting

00:26:16.080 --> 00:26:18.279
the gods of the pirate world.

00:26:18.279 --> 00:26:24.289
And Luffy starts the battle walking calmly
between them to help his fallen friend.

00:26:24.289 --> 00:26:29.649
Wow. What balls Luffy has.

00:26:29.649 --> 00:26:34.830
But it is an important moment in Luffy’s
journey. These two Emperors, Big Mom and Kaido,

00:26:34.830 --> 00:26:39.419
have ruled the seas for decades. They would
kill Luffy’s friends in an instant. But

00:26:39.419 --> 00:26:45.200
no longer does Luffy need to run away to protect
his friends. He can fight them, beat them,

00:26:45.200 --> 00:26:49.350
and move past them to achieve the dreams they
never could.

00:26:49.350 --> 00:26:54.920
In a flash of violent flame, Luffy unleashes
the special technique Red Roc. A gigantic

00:26:54.920 --> 00:26:59.539
version of the Red Hawk flame that symbolizes
his brother. Luffy smashes Kaido into the

00:26:59.539 --> 00:27:03.730
ground, making the Emperor bleed for the first
time against Luffy.

00:27:03.730 --> 00:27:09.130
But the rest of the battle does not go so
easily. Kaido is faster, stronger, and has

00:27:09.130 --> 00:27:14.200
more experience than Luffy. And Luffy’s
Ryo is not enough to seriously damage Kaido.

00:27:14.200 --> 00:27:19.460
The Straw Hat captain loses again and is cast
off into the sea to die. But the battle was

00:27:19.460 --> 00:27:21.270
not a waste.

00:27:21.270 --> 00:27:26.990
By fighting Kaido, Luffy learns another form
of Haki. Advanced Conquerors. Similar to Ryo,

00:27:26.990 --> 00:27:32.500
this allows Luffy to channel his unmatched
conqueror’s spirit into fists and feet.

00:27:32.500 --> 00:27:37.100
Luffy climbs back up to the top of the skull
dome and confronts Kaido once more.

00:27:37.100 --> 00:27:40.260
And this is where things get silly.

00:27:40.260 --> 00:27:45.669
Even with all of Luffy’s progress, all of
his Gears and advanced Haki, Kaido is still

00:27:45.669 --> 00:27:52.580
one step above. That is until Gear 5. Or,
as we learn, the true form of Luffy’s devil

00:27:52.580 --> 00:27:54.910
fruit, the Sun God Nika.

00:27:54.910 --> 00:28:00.491
And this, let me tell you, was a twist that
no one saw coming. In this form, Luffy turns

00:28:00.491 --> 00:28:06.149
completely white and cannot stop laughing.
He becomes a true representation of freedom,

00:28:06.149 --> 00:28:13.090
allowing Luffy to fully unleash the most incredible
power in the world: his imagination. Nicknamed

00:28:13.090 --> 00:28:18.160
Toon Force by One Piece fans, Luffy turns
the fight into a cartoon. He catches and throws

00:28:18.160 --> 00:28:23.590
lightning, punches straight through the Emperor,
and even turns dragon Kaido into a jump rope.

00:28:23.590 --> 00:28:28.809
The fight has become insanity. The warrior
of liberation has awoken.

00:28:28.809 --> 00:28:34.740
However, as with all of Luffy’s Gears, there
is a down side. We see during the fight that

00:28:34.740 --> 00:28:40.490
Luffy’s life span is dwindling. He repeatedly
turns into this wrinkly old man and seems

00:28:40.490 --> 00:28:43.010
exhausted by his wild transformation.

00:28:43.010 --> 00:28:49.260
But even the loss of life span doesn’t stop
our captain. In one last attack, Luffy rises

00:28:49.260 --> 00:28:54.409
into the clouds. Kaido hovers below him as
a flaming, destructive force of nature. The

00:28:54.409 --> 00:29:00.169
situation seems hopeless, but as with many
of Luffy’s fights, the answer is to simply

00:29:00.169 --> 00:29:05.039
punch harder. And that’s what Luffy does.
He comes out of the clouds with an enormous

00:29:05.039 --> 00:29:12.130
fist. And he smashes Kaido all the way through
Wano and into the volcanic lava below the

00:29:12.130 --> 00:29:13.130
island.

00:29:13.130 --> 00:29:17.300
With Big Mom defeated by other members of
the alliance, the Straw Hats are victorious,

00:29:17.300 --> 00:29:24.540
and days later Luffy is officially named an
Emperor of the Sea, with a new bounty of 3

00:29:24.540 --> 00:29:26.270
billion berries to back it up.

00:29:26.270 --> 00:29:30.490
And who knows what crazy new forms we will
see Luffy take before he finally finds the

00:29:30.490 --> 00:29:33.290
One Piece. However, as I explain in this video
right here, there is a really good chance

00:29:33.290 --> 00:29:37.169
that Luffy’s final bounty at the end of
the story will not only surpass that of the

00:29:37.169 --> 00:29:43.270
former Pirate King, but even exceed the crazy
amount of 10 Billion berries. If you want

00:29:43.270 --> 00:29:47.450
to find out more, make sure to watch that
video, right here. Shanks for watching.

